{"id":"n1-136","title":"Verb てみせる (Verb te miseru)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"'Show by doing', 'demonstrate', 'prove by action'.","longExplanation":"The ～てみせる grammar point is used to express the action of demonstrating or proving something by actually doing it. It can be translated as 'show by doing', 'demonstrate', or 'prove by action' in English.","formation":"Verb-て form + みせる","examples":[{"jp":"彼はそのパズルを解いてみせた。","romaji":"Kare wa sono pazuru o toite miseta.","en":"He solved the puzzle to show me.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"パズル","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"解い","vocabId":"1198890","reading":"とく","baseForm":"解く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みせ","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ","baseForm":"みせる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]},{"jp":"私はこの仕事ができることをやってみせます。","romaji":"Watashi wa kono shigoto ga dekiru koto o yatte misemasu.","en":"I will do this job to prove that I can.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"できる","vocabId":"1340450","reading":"できる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"やっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"やる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みせ","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ","baseForm":"みせる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[10]},{"jp":"彼女は試験に合格するために一生懸命勉強してみせました。","romaji":"Kanojo wa shiken ni gōkaku suru tame ni isshōkenmei benkyō shite misemashita.","en":"She studied hard to prove she could pass the exam.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一生懸命","vocabId":"1164010","reading":"いっしょうけんめい"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みせ","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ","baseForm":"みせる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[12]},{"jp":"彼は自分が何も恐れていないと跳んでみせた。","romaji":"Kare wa jibun ga nanimo osorete inai to tonde miseta.","en":"He jumped to show he wasn’t afraid of anything.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"自分","vocabId":"1318610","reading":"じぶん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"恐れ","vocabId":"1236660","reading":"おそれ","baseForm":"恐れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"跳ん","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"跳ぶ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みせ","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ","baseForm":"みせる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[13]}]}